        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEREBRUM Remastered - Awaken Alone. Fight Your Friends. Save Them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br>Greyne awakens from a long slumber to find a world plunged into nightmare. The vile RESERVE and his mysterious accomplice have trapped every inhabitant in an eternal bad dream. Greyne's friends are no longer themselves; their fears and pain have twisted them into terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But within this despair lies a spark of hope: Greyne discovers that by defeating these monsters, he can free the captured souls. Each conquered boss transforms back and joins him as a playable character with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, unite the strength of the rescued, and venture deeper into the heart of the nightmare to stop RESERVE and his sinister ally once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nightmare You Must Escape From:</strong> Face the monstrous versions of your friends in boss battles that will leave you restless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Your Allies:</strong> Unlock each defeated boss as a playable character, rousing them from their nightmare sleep to utilize their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>United We Stand, Asleep We Fall:</strong> Combine your team's powers to explore new dreamlike realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake Your Brain!:</strong> Master challenging 2D puzzle-platformers that require wit and skill, promising hopefully not too many sleepless nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatter the Nightmare. Fight your friends to save them. Defy RESERVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEREBRUM Remastered - Awaken Alone. Fight Your Friends. Save Them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br>Greyne awakens from a long slumber to find a world plunged into nightmare. The vile RESERVE and his mysterious accomplice have trapped every inhabitant in an eternal bad dream. Greyne's friends are no longer themselves; their fears and pain have twisted them into terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But within this despair lies a spark of hope: Greyne discovers that by defeating these monsters, he can free the captured souls. Each conquered boss transforms back and joins him as a playable character with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, unite the strength of the rescued, and venture deeper into the heart of the nightmare to stop RESERVE and his sinister ally once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nightmare You Must Escape From:</strong> Face the monstrous versions of your friends in boss battles that will leave you restless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Your Allies:</strong> Unlock each defeated boss as a playable character, rousing them from their nightmare sleep to utilize their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>United We Stand, Asleep We Fall:</strong> Combine your team's powers to explore new dreamlike realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake Your Brain!:</strong> Master challenging 2D puzzle-platformers that require wit and skill, promising hopefully not too many sleepless nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatter the Nightmare. Fight your friends to save them. Defy RESERVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Fight the nightmare monsters that your friends have become, free them, and awaken a team with unique powers to defeat the evil.",
